          "arguments": "{\"message\":\"Turn two, drawing this Brontodon, big dino with a sac ability, like a walking wrecking ball for artifacts or enchantments, makes me think of those old movies where dinosaurs stomp through cities, but here it's just gonna stomp some random bauble probably, or maybe nothing if you don't play any, which reminds me of that time I built a deck full of dinos and it just sat there looking pretty without doing much, like a museum exhibit come to life but too polite to roar... anyway, playing a Forest to get that green mana flowing, gotta set up for the big plays, you know?\"}",
