\n\
I have 3 untapped lands and 1 land drop. My Nocturnal Feeder is flying, which is important because I can't block the Ravenous Giant.\n\
\n\
**Strategic assessment:** \n\
- The Ravenous Giant is a massive threat (5/5). I need to either kill it or find a way around it.\n\
- **Stab Wound** ({2}{B}) enchants a creature and makes it -2/-2 + drain 2 each upkeep. On a 5/5, this makes it 3/3 and still strong, but the upkeep drain is valuable.\n\
- **Masked Blackguard** is a decent body that curves out.\n\
\n\
**Play order:** I should:\n\
1. Play a land to continue building mana\n\
2. Cast **Stab Wound** on the Ravenous Giant to nerf it and start the drain\n\
\n\
