      "reasoning": "**Turn 5!** I created 2 goblin tokens (both sick), so opponent went to 17 HP (must have taken damage from Nocturnal Feeder + got hit before I saw the board). Opponent tapped their Ravenous Giant to attack me with it!\n\
\n\
