- **Masked Blackguard** (2/1) — would die to the 5/5\n\
- **Goblin Token** (1/1) — would die\n\
- **Goblin Token** (1/1) — would die\n\
\n\
All my blockers would die. But let me think: **if I don't block**, I take 5 damage (20 → 15). **If I block with a goblin token**, I lose a token but still take 5 damage (since the Giant is bigger). \n\
\n\
**Wait:** The Masked Blackguard has flash and an ability ({2}{B}: gets +1/+1). If I can boost it before combat, maybe... but combat is already happening. Blocking with a 2/1 against a 5/5 doesn't help either.\n\
\n\
**Optimal play:** Don't block. Save my creatures. I'll take 5 damage and reset:",
