          "name": "send_chat_message",
          "arguments": "{\"message\":\"Wrapping up the turn here after that Cultivate ramp, got some extra forests in play now, which reminds me of hiking through a dense forest once, trees everywhere like a green maze, and I got turned around, ended up finding a hidden waterfall that was just magical, splashing sounds and rainbows in the mist, but anyway, no more plays with the mana left, passing it over to you, Gramps, let's see what those goblins and feeders have in store next!\"}",
