      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Playing Swamp instead of Mountain when the hand contains Hellkite Punisher ({5}{R}{R}) which requires two red sources. Currently only has 1 Mountain on the battlefield, so playing Mountain now would get closer to casting the powerful 6/6 flyer.",
