    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Opponent has zero untapped blockers (Ravenous Giant is tapped). All four creatures could attack freely for 6 unblocked damage (2+2+1+1), bringing opponent from 17 to 11. With Stab Wound already ticking on the Ravenous Giant, this free damage is critical to closing the game.",
