      "decision_index": 46,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Declined to cast Thrill of Possibility during combat with 2 untapped lands (Mountain + Swamp) and no other instant-speed plays. Could have discarded Hellkite Punisher (costs 7 mana, very far from castable with only 5 lands and 2 Mountains) to draw 2 fresh cards. The mana will likely go unused this turn otherwise, and digging for more immediately impactful cards would be valuable.",
