    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Failed to attack with a 4/3 trampling Ravenous Giant when all of the opponent's creatures were tapped. This is a free 4 damage to an opponent at 15 life. With Stab Wound and Ravenous Giant both draining 3 life per upkeep, Grok4 Rambler is on a very fast clock at 8 life and desperately needs to deal damage quickly.",
